6. Components not included in the initial public bundle
--------------------------------------------------------

- The optional openNURBS exact-Brep writer helper is not bundled while its redistribution requirements are under review. Narwhal reports the resulting exact `.3dm` limitation and directs users to STEP for exact solid interchange.
- CorelDRAW conversion support uses the independently developed TraceDraw CLI when it is installed locally. TraceDraw is dual-licensed MIT or Apache-2.0, but no TraceDraw executable is included in the 0.4.0 AppImage because an immutable/reproducible platform build has not yet been locked. See https://github.com/igtoth/tracedraw.
- Inkscape, Poppler, Ghostscript, LibreOffice, and TraceDraw are not included in the 0.4.0 converter pack. Features requiring them report the missing optional dependency; they do not claim those tools are bundled.

